  [38;5;153mCOLUMN notes;[39m and update [38;5;153mschema.sql[39m to match — that's it, nothing fancy. One note on the mechanics: SQLite only
  supports [38;5;153mDROP COLUMN[39m from 3.35.0 onward; on older versions this needs the table-rebuild dance. Tell me which
